{{/*
openeverest.contract.annotations renders the annotations of an object
OpenEverest interprets: the stamp, the contract version of the OpenEverest
this chart was built against, which provider-sdk generate writes into
Chart.yaml, then those set in the value openeverest.annotations. Include it,
with the root context, in metadata.annotations of the Provider and of any
BackupStorageClass, MonitoringClass or ClusterInstancePreset the chart applies:

  annotations:
    {{- include "openeverest.contract.annotations" . | nindent 4 }}

When compatibility.acknowledge.coreVersion is set, it renders it too, as
openeverest.io/compatibility-acknowledged. provider-runtime reads it on the
Provider and lets a new build start on the releases that acknowledgement
covers, as the check below lets the install through.
*/}}
